notes: |
  Champion v8 — seasonal (New-York-time weekly profile) HAR-EWMA scale-mixture model: robust
  (mean-|r|) level from three EWMAs mixed by lead time, calendar event multipliers (CPI, NFP, PPI,
  retail sales, GDP/PCE, FOMC, earnings), exactly-zero steps and price-grid rounding, Student-t x
  log-normal per-path mixture with an extra weekend-specific factor, stratified (Latin-hypercube) draws. CPU only, closed form,
  ~0.1 s per 24h prompt, ~0.03 s per 1h prompt; artifacts agent/profiles.npz + agent/events.json.
  Official backtester (agent/predict.py = synth-lib backtest, 1000 paths, the validator's own
  prompt times, the 10 days of scored prompts before 2026-11-08), mean CRPS over assets:
                  starter (log-normal martingale)   champion v8   change
    CRYPTO_24H        4606.76                        4432.82       -3.78%  (5 assets, 1200 prompts)
    COM_EQU_24H       3304.04                        3035.10       -8.14%  (8 assets, 870 prompts)
    CRYPTO_1H          988.40                         925.40       -6.37%  (5 assets, 7200 prompts)
  (v7, without the weekend factor: 4436.95 / 3037.12 / 925.40; the 1h path is unchanged in v8.)
